    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow Game is a game where you read books made for cats and spot the typos. As you immerse yourself in these feline-centric books, you might start questioning if you\u2019ve turned into a cat. But don\u2019t worry\u2014rest assured, that\u2019s not happening. If it feels like it, maybe it\u2019s time to take a short break!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Focus and carefully read the books to find the typos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Use Meowgle to search for anything you\u2019re curious about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Save a variety of adorable cat photos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Relax and heal your mind by simply watching the cats.</p>",
